<title>JAPAN: Maruyoshi applies for listing on TSE 2nd section.</title>
<headline>Maruyoshi applies for listing on TSE 2nd section.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maruyoshi Co Ltd, currently an over-the-counter issue, has applied to list on the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE), the exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The listing of the plywood and housing-related products firm is expected on November 5, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>It has already issued 9.41 million shares but it plans to publicly offer an additional one million shares on the day of the listing, the stock exchange said.</p>
</text>
